        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana 7FBR, 7 Inch Flush Bolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Deltana 7 Inch Flush Bolts (also know as an door edge bolt) is installed into the edge of the door. The toggle lever is moved up and down to push the attached rod and door bolt into a header or threshold (footer), which locks or unlocks an inactive door. Packaged complete with 7 Inch flush bolt, <a href=\"/products/strike-plate-for-flush-bolt-deltana-sp7fbr\">flush bolt strike plate</a> and brass wood screws. Available in 9 different finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-7FBR.gif?v=1704354577\" width=\"600\" height=\"251\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana 7FBR 7 Inch Flush Bolt Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-4-inch-flush-bolts-with-square-corners-deltana-4fbs\">4\" Flush Bolt</a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-6-inch-flush-bolts-with-square-corners-deltana-del-6fbs\">6\" Flush Bolt with Square Corners</a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-6-inch-flush-bolts-with-round-corners-deltana-del-6fbr\">6\" Flush Bolt with Round Corners</a> - \r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-extension-flush-bolts-12-18-and-24-inches-deltana-del-efb\">Extension Flush Bolts in 12\", 18\", 24\"</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Deltana 7FBR 7\" Flush Bolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Length: 7-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Width: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Thickness: 1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Handle Plate Corner: Round</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Diameter: 3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Bolt Throw: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Length: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Width: 5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike Plate Thickness: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/7FBR.pdf?v=1691095270\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana 7FBR Dimension Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nNo matter which finish you choose for the outside, it will still be solid brass material inside.\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Solid Brass 7 Inch Flush Bolt",
                "description": "Deltana 7FBR 7 Inch Flush Bolt - This solid brass 7 Inch Flush Bolts (also know as an door edge bolt) is installed into the edge of the door. The toggle lever is moved up and down to push the attached rod and door bolt into a header or threshold (footer), which locks or unlocks an inactive door. Comes complete with flush bolt matching finish screws, strike plate and bolt guide. Available in 9 different finishes.",
                "keywords": "DEL-7FBR 7 Inch Flush Bolts, deltana 7FBR Solid Brass 7 Inch Flush Bolts, Deltana Flush Bolt Round Corners, 7 inch flushbolts, 7 flush door bolts, deltana flush door bolts, 7 inch round flush bolts, 7 inches door flush bolts, french door edge bolts, long door bolts,  lock french doors, french door locks, 7 inch edge door bolts, french door bolts, DEL-7FBR3 brass door bolts, DEL-7FBR10B, DEL-7FBR15, DEL-7FBR15A, DEL-7FBR19, DEL-7FBR26, DEL-7FBR26D, DEL-7FBR5, DEL-7FBRCR003,"
